'''Mega Rising''' (Japanese: '''メガライジング''') is the twelfth expansion of cards in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Mega Rising''' is the twelfth expansion released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]], the first expansion of Series B, and the fifth main expansion. It introduces {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}}, a more powerful but risky variant of {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} worth 3 points when Knocked Out.

The expansion's three booster packs focus on three Mega Evolution Pokémon: Mega {{p|Gyarados}}, Mega {{p|Blaziken}}, and Mega {{p|Altaria}}.

Mega Rising was released on October 30, 2025, on the game's first anniversary. It was inadvertedly revealed on October 15, 2025 via an update to the Japanese and Chinese How to Play guides on the official website.<ref>[https://bulbagarden.net/threads/mega-rising-the-next-expansion-for-pokemon-tcg-pocket-inadvertently-revealed-in-update-to-japanese-official-website.308731/ Mega Rising, the next expansion for Pokémon TCG Pocket, inadvertently revealed in update to Japanese official website | Bulbagarden]</ref>

